{
 "meta": {
  "lane": "b",
  "task": "t120",
  "chunk": "b/052",
  "family": "WAR20"
 },
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u17224",
   "en": "Time to get moving.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17225",
   "en": "I don't really have time to spare right now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17226",
   "en": "This really isn't the time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17227",
   "en": "I'll look around if I get the chance.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17228",
   "en": "You're awfully quick to trust me with this.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17229",
   "en": "I'm not interested in this.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17230",
   "en": "I'm done with this planet.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17231",
   "en": "Everybody wants something. Hurry up about it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17232",
   "en": "Data",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17233",
   "en": "Reason for being here",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17234",
   "en": "Just get to the point.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17235",
   "en": "I'm not sticking around.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17236",
   "en": "I might be able to help.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17237",
   "en": "I found your data.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17238",
   "en": "Reason for the attack",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17239",
   "en": "Just keep it in mind while you are out there. Good luck, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17240",
   "en": "I haven't found your workstation or data yet.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17241",
   "en": "I didn't find anything.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17242",
   "en": "No catch, really. It's dangerous work, but not for someone like you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17243",
   "en": "Well, I appreciate it. Here. You've certainly earned this.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17244",
   "en": "You bet. Thanks for all your help, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17245",
   "en": "Sounds easy enough. What's the catch?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17246",
   "en": "It wasn't too difficult.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17247",
   "en": "Just give me my credits and I'll be on my way.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17248",
   "en": "I was there anyway. It was the least I could do.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17249",
   "en": "All right. I'll help.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17250",
   "en": "Thanks again, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17251",
   "en": "Please keep your fire to a minimum when you go to the ExoGeni building. We want to minimize damage.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17252",
   "en": "Oh, and I must inform you that the company will not be responsible for any injuries you sustain while in our facility.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17253",
   "en": "None. We're scrambling to find anything of value.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17254",
   "en": "Please. ExoGeni Corp. is the premier engine of colonization in the new multi-system economy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17255",
   "en": "And in conjunction with our core interests, exploration provides a broad investment base for shareholders.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17256",
   "en": "ExoGeni has a number of subsidiary companies in many different fields. The most profitable adapt alien technologies.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17257",
   "en": "There are many other industrial branches, but they aren't really relevant to Feros.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17258",
   "en": "Me? I was sent here to do some routine estimations of the potential return on investment.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17259",
   "en": "I can't wait for the home office to get me off this rock.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17260",
   "en": "Please be careful if you go to headquarters. We don't want any unnecessary damage to the facility.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17261",
   "en": "Still here? No rush, I suppose. ExoGeni will sort things out, given time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17262",
   "en": "I know what you did on Torfan. There's no reason for this to get bloody.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17263",
   "en": "Commander. Glad to see you survived your encounter with the Thorian.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17264",
   "en": "Do you have any idea why the geth attacked you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17265",
   "en": "Tell me about ExoGeni.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17266",
   "en": "What are the company's \"core interests\"?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17267",
   "en": "Tell me about yourself, Jeong.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17268",
   "en": "Not this time, Jeong. You need to back down and let them go.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17269",
   "en": "What do you think you're doing, Jeong?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17270",
   "en": "If that's the way it has to be, then come on! ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17271",
   "en": "Opportunities? What the hell are you talking about?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17272",
   "en": "Well, yeah. No one's ever gone broke playing the \"champion of humanity\" card.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17273",
   "en": "Nice! I guess it could be left intentionally undeveloped to capitalize on its \"rough\" appeal. Right?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17274",
   "en": "Sadly, you'd probably make a killing. But if it will let us get back to our lives, I'm for it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17275",
   "en": "It just might work. Wait, no, but the infected colonists will throw a bit of a wrench in that plan. No, no. They need to disappear.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17276",
   "en": "ExoGeni will send more assayers. They'll know what happened.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17277",
   "en": "But if word gets out about the Thorian.... How do I know they'll stay quiet?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17278",
   "en": "I won't shut up! I'll talk about it to anyone who will listen!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17279",
   "en": "But-- But it's not fair. Not after everything.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17280",
   "en": "I guess that's all that matters now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17281",
   "en": "Take the money and run. It seems like that's all anyone cares about.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17282",
   "en": "Communications are back up. ExoGeni wants this place purged.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17283",
   "en": "You don't understand. It's not that easy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17284",
   "en": "This is a human colony, Jeong. You can't just re-purpose us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17285",
   "en": "I won't let you hurt these people any more. Drop your weapon or be prepared to use it!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17286",
   "en": "Can't you see the inherent potential in this colony? Think of the promotional opportunities!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17287",
   "en": "They recovered from an alien attack on a frontier world. Add that to your company profile.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17288",
   "en": "Pitch it as \"Humanity against all odds!\" You could even sell tickets to wealthy adventurers.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17289",
   "en": "Pay them. Give them passage off this world and be done with it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17290",
   "en": "They lose even more if they talk. Besides, there's no real crime to report if you let them go.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17291",
   "en": "This isn't so bad. At least you have your life. You can start over anywhere.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17292",
   "en": "Let's get this over with.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17293",
   "en": "If they talk, they lose everything for no reason at all. They'll stay quiet.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17294",
   "en": "Are you going to tell them about the Thorian, or should I?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17295",
   "en": "You're after the one unique thing Feros has: the Thorian.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17296",
   "en": "If you kill only the Thorian, it might be enough to stop the infection. Maybe.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17297",
   "en": "Just make sure there's no evidence when you're done.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17298",
   "en": "Maybe there is. Come and talk to me before you leave, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17299",
   "en": "There has to be another way.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17300",
   "en": "All traces of the Thorian will be erased in short order. Feros will have a second chance thanks to you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17301",
   "en": "It's worth a try, but I don't know if I can avoid harming the colonists.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17302",
   "en": "Good plan. Except that the colonists stand between me and the Thorian.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17303",
   "en": "Anything hostile will be eliminated.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17304",
   "en": "You shouldn't be wasting time. Deal with the Thorian.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17305",
   "en": "Let them go!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17306",
   "en": "Explain yourself!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17307",
   "en": "Species 37.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17308",
   "en": "I'm ending this now!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17309",
   "en": "What about the big picture?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17310",
   "en": "Just pay them off.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17311",
   "en": "Feros will be a symbol.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17312",
   "en": "Movie rights and tourism!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17313",
   "en": "Sounds logical.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17314",
   "en": "They'll try to stop me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17315",
   "en": "Can't take that chance.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17316",
   "en": "Think about it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17317",
   "en": "They won't talk.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17318",
   "en": "It could be worse.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17319",
   "en": "Geth attack",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17320",
   "en": "ExoGeni Corporation",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17321",
   "en": "Core interests?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17322",
   "en": "Hah, Shepard. Damn it! I knew it was too much to hope the geth would kill you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17323",
   "en": "Hold it right there, Commander. This is an ExoGeni project. I'm taking control.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17324",
   "en": "It's a telepathic life-form living under Zhu's Hope.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17325",
   "en": "A Spectre? That's a load of crap. There aren't any human Spectres. Right?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17326",
   "en": "You're a bean-counter, Jeong. I'm a Spectre. Tell me, how good are those odds?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17327",
   "en": "I'll kill you first.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17328",
   "en": "I know what you did during the Blitz, but your heroics aren't needed here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17329",
   "en": "I know what happened on Akuze. This doesn't have to end like that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17330",
   "en": "We can talk this out. Nobody needs to get hurt.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17331",
   "en": "I think this plan of yours just might work.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17332",
   "en": "I'm preparing the proposal for ExoGeni. I think they'll like it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17333",
   "en": "I don't know. It's a crazy idea. But, hey, if there's money involved, maybe ExoGeni will at least consider it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17334",
   "en": "Still here, Shepard. Don't worry. I won't renege on our deal.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17335",
   "en": "Now that there's no evidence, we can all just leave.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17336",
   "en": "The colonists will soon be moving on to their new lives.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17337",
   "en": "It's a pricey solution, but better than the alternative.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17338",
   "en": "I like people. I just like them more when they're helping ExoGeni profit.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17339",
   "en": "Someone needs to worry about the bottom line. I'm the only one left.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17340",
   "en": "There's nothing here to warrant an invasion. There's barely enough here to warrant a colony.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17341",
   "en": "The attack was certainly a surprise to me. I've been trapped here ever since.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17342",
   "en": "I found some interesting facts about you in the ExoGeni database.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17343",
   "en": "It's not just you. There's something here far more valuable than a few colonists.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17344",
   "en": "It's taking control of the colonists there. ExoGeni knew all along.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17345",
   "en": "You won't get away with this, Jeong.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17346",
   "en": "So you keep saying. But nobody's going to miss a few colonists.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17347",
   "en": "Is that really a chance you're willing to take, Jeong?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17348",
   "en": "Yeah, but the infected colonists can't be here when the company men come.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17349",
   "en": "You can't just kill the colonists. It's not their fault.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17350",
   "en": "Then you'd be the first one to go to prison. Your signature's on half the Thorian reports. ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17351",
   "en": "For this to work, there can't be any evidence. The infected colonists need to disappear.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17352",
   "en": "You're not much of a people person, are you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17353",
   "en": "What are you doing to these people?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17354",
   "en": "Tell them the geth destroyed the Thorian.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17355",
   "en": "Make the offer sweet enough and they'll take it. And they won't risk losing it all just to talk.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17356",
   "en": "Life isn't fair, Lizbeth. It's about time you realized that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17357",
   "en": "You've gone way too far. This ends now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17358",
   "en": "Control?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17359",
   "en": "I can't let you do this.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17360",
   "en": "No, they won't",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17361",
   "en": "Will they?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17362",
   "en": "Convince them otherwise.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17363",
   "en": "You're naïve.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17364",
   "en": "More valuable than lives?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17365",
   "en": "They won't miss you, either.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17366",
   "en": "It's a gimmick.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17367",
   "en": "You see? You worry too much.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17368",
   "en": "And you trust too easily, Juliana.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17369",
   "en": "Don't worry about him. He only cares about \"the company\".",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17370",
   "en": "Relax, Jeong. They're obviously not geth. ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17371",
   "en": "As if we don't have enough problems. Now we're shooting each other in the back.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17372",
   "en": "It's my fault. I knew what was going on and I didn't do anything.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17373",
   "en": "Don't you start. You do good work and you know it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  }
 ]
}
